<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 71.36 mln rand S.Africa bonds Wed.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 71.36 mln rand S.Africa bonds Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 71.36 million rand worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after selling 31.81 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
